<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-raspopovic-bmp-sox9-wnt-digits-code-traceability> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Raspopovic et al. (2014) 3-node Bmp-Sox9-Wnt Turing digit patterning network modulated by distal FGF — Code-to-model traceability: 68/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Functions compute J_3, J_eff, and 1D reaction-diffusion dynamics (L35-145), but lack explicit equation-level docstrings cross-referencing Raspopovic et al. (2014) Figs. 2-4, Marcon et al. (2016) eLife, Sheth et al. (2012) Science, and the 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_016_bmp_sox9_wnt_digits.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-code-traceability> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/code-traceability" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2014-raspopovic-bmp-sox9-wnt-digits.py L35–L145: Brief docstrings without explicit paper figure/equation or Lean 4 theorem mappings <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45d4150/2014-raspopovic-bmp-sox9-wnt-digits.py#L35-L145>" ;
    pk:hasScore 6.8e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "mostly faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-raspopovic-bmp-sox9-wnt-digits-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Raspopovic et al. (2014) 3-node Bmp-Sox9-Wnt Turing digit patterning network modulated by distal FGF — Model fidelity to source: 59/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Implements the 3-node Bmp-Sox9-Wnt Jacobian J_3 (D_S = 0) and reduced 2-diffuser Jacobian J_eff (L35-59),dispersion curve Re(sigma(q)) (L62-88), and 1D reaction-diffusion integration along a constant-parameter arc (L91-145), backed by 3 Lean 4 theorems in `Loop_016_bmp_sox9_wnt_digits.lean`. However, it omits the 2D fan-shaped limb bud autopod domain where distal AER-FGF gradient modulation prevents radial digit bifurcation, and lacks the zero-diffusion (D_B = D_W = 0) negative control." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "2014-raspopovic-bmp-sox9-wnt-digits.py L91–L145: Only 1D constant-parameter arc simulated without 2D fan-shaped autopod FGF gradient modulation or D=0 negative control <https://github.com/fractastical/morpholib/blob/45d4150/2014-raspopovic-bmp-sox9-wnt-digits.py#L91-L145>" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-raspopovic-bmp-sox9-wnt-digits-model-fidelity-1> ;
    pk:hasScore 5.9e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "partially faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-raspopovic-bmp-sox9-wnt-digits-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Raspopovic et al. (2014) 3-node Bmp-Sox9-Wnt Turing digit patterning network modulated by distal FGF — Morphometric validation: 56/100" ;
